  "term": "bulbospongiosus muscle",
  "definition": "The bulbospongiosus muscle is a muscle in the vulvo-perineal area, near the rear part of the perineum. In the source, it is identified as part of the perineal muscle region where oxygen saturation was measured in women with and without dyspareunia.",
